\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father of mercies, in Thy word
\par What endless glory shines!
\par For ever be Thy name adored
\par For these celestial lines.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Here may the wretched sons of want
\par Exhaustless riches find;
\par Riches, above what earth can grant,
\par And lasting as the mind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Here the fair tree of knowledge grows,
\par And yields a free repast;
\par Sublimer sweets than nature knows
\par Invite the longing taste.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Here the redeemer's welcome voice
\par Spread heavenly peace around;
\par And life and everlasting joys
\par Attend the blissful sound.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Divine instructor, gracious Lord,
\par Be Thou for ever near;
\par Teach me to love Thy sacred word,
\par And view my Saviour there.
\par                              Amen.\f1 
\par \lang1033\f2 
\par }

